================================================================================
HUMANEVAL
================================================================================

The benchmark in `bench/run_humaneval.py` and `runs/` is HumanEval
(Chen et al., 2021, "Evaluating Large Language Models Trained on Code",
arXiv:2107.03374). The task set and its unit tests are used here as the
evaluation oracle; the task files are not redistributed in this repository
and must be obtained from the original source.

